先任命毕諴为刑部侍郎，六月初八日癸酉，就任命他为邠宁节度使。","content_jianti_auto":"5党项复扰边，上欲择可为邠宁帅者而难其人，从容与翰林学士、中书舍人须昌毕𫍯论边事，𫍯援古据今，具陈方略。上悦曰：「吾方择帅，不意颇、牧近在禁廷。卿其为朕行乎！」𫍯欣然奉命。上欲重其资履，六月，壬申，先以𫍯为刑部侍郞，癸酉，乃除邠宁节度使。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":25385,"number":5,"reading_annotation_sources":[{"count":1,"source":"资治通鉴考异","source_key":"资治通鉴考异"}],"start_index":5,"tongjian_id":"c4bf3781-db0e-11ef-b72f-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"link_death_year":852,"link_td_description":"李渼，唐朝皇子，唐宣宗子，生母不详。","link_td_id":"Q10013368","link_td_number_id":1593834,"people_name":"雍王","people_name_jianti_auto":"雍王","people_xingming":"李渼","start_index":1,"tongjian_id":"c4c180c0-db0e-11ef-8f3c-a0d3651f611f"},{"link_death_year":852,"link_td_description":"李渼，唐朝皇子，唐宣宗子，生母不详。","link_td_id":"Q10013368","link_td_number_id":1593834,"people_name":"渼","people_name_jianti_auto":"渼","people_xingming":"李渼","start_index":3,"tongjian_id":"c4c180c1-db0e-11ef-938a-a0d3651f611f"},{"link_death_year":852,"link_td_description":"李渼，唐朝皇子，唐宣宗子，生母不详。","link_td_id":"Q10013368","link_td_number_id":1593834,"people_name":"靖懷太子","people_name_jianti_auto":"靖怀太子","people_xingming":"李渼","start_index":8,"tongjian_id":"c4c180c2-db0e-11ef-b042-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[],"class_tags":["人事"],"content":"6雍王渼薨，追諡靖懷太子。","content_fanyi":"雍王李渼去世，被追谥为靖怀太子。","content_jianti_auto":"6雍王渼薨，追谥靖怀太子。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":25386,"number":6,"reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":6,"tongjian_id":"c4c180be-db0e-11ef-bbc1-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[{"confidence":0.95,"official_category":"地方行政","official_name":"河東節度使","official_note":"河東節度使是唐代在河東地區（今山西一帶）設置的軍事和行政長官，掌管地方軍政，此處指李業擔任此職，因行為不當導致邊境動亂。","official_rank":"正二品至從二品","source_snippet":"河東節度使李業","start_index":7,"tongjian_id":"fc2ca267-13bf-4940-95b2-f721e0f2ac19"},{"confidence":0.9,"official_category":"文教","official_name":"太子少師","official_note":"太子少師是東宮官職，負責教導太子，此處盧鈞以此職被任命為河東節度使，顯示其地位和信任。","official_rank":"正二品","source_snippet":"以太子少師盧鈞爲河東節度使","start_index":38,"tongjian_id":"a5664f1a-41c7-45d6-b2bf-c3fdb85a760c"},{"confidence":0.95,"official_category":"地方行政","official_name":"河東節度使","official_note":"河東節度使是唐代在河東地區（今山西一帶）設置的軍事和行政長官，此處盧鈞接替李業擔任此職，以穩定邊境。","official_rank":"正二品至從二品","source_snippet":"以太子少師盧鈞爲河東節度使","start_index":45,"tongjian_id":"bb5e2863-85e9-4ac1-bea3-b587107af60b"},{"confidence":0.9,"official_category":"地方行政","official_name":"義成節度使","official_note":"義成節度使是唐代在義成地區（今河南一帶）設置的軍事和行政長官，此處李業被調任此職，作為對其過失的處理。","official_rank":"正二品至從二品","source_snippet":"但徙義成節度使","start_index":71,"tongjian_id":"f1b8adb4-9af6-4bd4-a78e-aeb7475335ad"}],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"link_td_description":"李业，唐朝军事人物，李虎的第七子李祎的六世孙。","link_td_id":"Q10014951","link_td_number_id":3211121,"people_name":"李業","people_name_jianti_auto":"李业","people_xingming":"李业","start_index":6,"tongjian_id":"c4c180c4-db0e-11ef-82f8-a0d3651f611f"},{"link_birth_year":778,"link_death_year":864,"link_td_description":"卢钧，字子和，唐代诗人，祖籍幽州范阳（今河北涿州）人，徙居京兆蓝田（今陕西蓝田）。出自范阳卢氏北祖大房，卢计子。","link_td_id":"Q10005006","link_td_number_id":5497766,"people_name":"盧鈞","people_name_jianti_auto":"卢钧","people_xingming":"卢钧","start_index":40,"tongjian_id":"c4c180c5-db0e-11ef-a4aa-a0d3651f611f"},{"link_td_description":"李业，唐朝军事人物，李虎的第七子李祎的六世孙。","link_td_id":"Q10014951","link_td_number_id":3211121,"people_name":"業","people_name_jianti_auto":"业","people_xingming":"李业","start_index":49,"tongjian_id":"c4c180c6-db0e-11ef-81cb-a0d3651f611f"},{"link_birth_year":793,"link_death_year":858,"link_td_description":"魏谟，字申之，唐朝官员，唐宣宗年间拜为宰相。","l