rce_snippet":"度支郞中韋宙爲副使","start_index":10,"tongjian_id":"7ca19389-252c-4e89-9527-0e0794af5227"}],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"link_birth_year":778,"link_death_year":864,"link_td_description":"卢钧，字子和，唐代诗人，祖籍幽州范阳（今河北涿州）人，徙居京兆蓝田（今陕西蓝田）。出自范阳卢氏北祖大房，卢计子。","link_td_id":"Q10005006","link_td_number_id":5497766,"people_name":"盧鈞","people_name_jianti_auto":"卢钧","people_xingming":"卢钧","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"c4c180cd-db0e-11ef-898d-a0d3651f611f"},{"link_td_description":"韦宙，京兆府万年县（今陕西省西安市）人，出自京兆韦氏郧公房，曾任岭南东路节度使，后加职尚书左仆射、同平章事，南汉追尊襄皇帝刘隐的外叔祖。","link_td_id":"Q10003215","link_td_number_id":2739280,"people_name":"韋宙","people_name_jianti_auto":"韦宙","people_xingming":"韦宙","start_index":7,"tongjian_id":"c4c180ce-db0e-11ef-9ee5-a0d3651f611f"},{"link_td_description":"韦宙，京兆府万年县（今陕西省西安市）人，出自京兆韦氏郧公房，曾任岭南东路节度使，后加职尚书左仆射、同平章事，南汉追尊襄皇帝刘隐的外叔祖。","link_td_id":"Q10003215","link_td_number_id":2739280,"people_name":"宙","people_name_jianti_auto":"宙","people_xingming":"韦宙","start_index":13,"tongjian_id":"c4c180cf-db0e-11ef-9bb6-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"唐","place_name_jianti_auto":"唐","resolved_place_entity_id":44,"start_index":30,"tongjian_id":"c4c180d0-db0e-11ef-96d9-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[],"class_tags":["人事","外交"],"content":"盧鈞奏度支郞中韋宙爲副使。宙徧詣塞下，悉召酋長，諭以禍福，禁唐民毋得入虜境侵掠，犯者必死，雜虜由是遂安。","content_fanyi":"卢钧上奏请求任命度支郎中韦宙为副使。韦宙走遍塞下各处，将杂虏酋长全部召集起来，向他们讲明祸福利害，禁止唐朝百姓进入杂虏境内侵犯抢掠，违犯者一律处死，杂虏从此安定下来。","content_jianti_auto":"卢钧奏度支郞中韦宙为副使。宙徧诣塞下，悉召酋长，谕以祸福，禁唐民毋得入虏境侵掠，犯者必死，杂虏由是遂安。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":25388,"reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":8,"tongjian_id":"c4c180cb-db0e-11ef-9368-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"